# Database Layer

- All models in `packages/db/src/models/`
- Use `connectDB()` singleton — never create new connections
- Extend `AbstractRepository` for complex query modules
- Add indexes on frequently queried fields
- Seed baseline data via `packages/db/src/seed.ts`
- GridFS uploads via `getUploadsBucket()`

Never import `@crm/db` in Edge runtime (middleware).
